OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers call for food rules update
OL,4,Aafter heatwaves
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers have said they have had to
OL,7,Fthrow away their produce because this
OL,8,Fsummer's extreme heat has caused fruit
OL,9,Fand veg to grow in unusual shapes or
OL,10,Fcolours - meaning retailers will not
OL,11,Fbuy it.
OL,13,FThey said they were calling for the
OL,14,Fgovernment to update the current
OL,15,Fappearance standards to help the
OL,16,Fcountry avoid "a future food security
OL,17,Fcrisis".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
