OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1788087394
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers call for food rules update
OL,4,Aafter heatwaves
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Pullen, a potato grower in
OL,7,FTintinhull near Yeovil, said he was
OL,8,Ffacing #200,000 losses due to his
OL,9,Fproduce appearing bruised or not
OL,10,Fgrowing at all. He said retailers would
OL,11,Fnot purchase such produce.
OL,13,FSarah Dyke, MP for Somerton and
OL,14,FGlastonbury, said she was calling for
OL,15,Fretailers to relax "rigid appearance
OL,16,Fstandards" which she described as
OL,17,F"absurd".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
